OL,3,GNEWSADig fails to prove world's oldest
OL,4,Aplatform claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers excavating what is claimed
OL,7,Fto be the world's oldest railway
OL,8,Fstation platform have admitted they
OL,9,Fhave found "no silver bullet" to prove
OL,10,Fthe boast.
OL,12,FHeighington Station, which dates to
OL,13,Fback to 1827 and was part of the first
OL,14,Fpassenger railway in the world to use
OL,15,Fsteam trains, was bought by the charity
OL,16,FFriends of the Stockton and Darlington
OL,17,FRailway (FOSD) last year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
