OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADig fails to prove world's oldest
OL,4,Aplatform claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeologists and volunteers have been
OL,7,Fdigging around the station for the past
OL,8,Ftwo weeks and volunteer Bethany
OL,9,FCochrane said she had only found
OL,10,F"rubble and rubbish" so far but the
OL,11,Fexperience had been valuable.
OL,13,FFOSD chair Niall Hammond said
OL,14,FHeighington was in effect the "world's
OL,15,Ffirst attempt" at a railway station.
